Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:02:05.90,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 女单决赛
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:05.90,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}莱巴金娜 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}4 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}5-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}2{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 萨巴伦卡 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:03.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Now, we'd like to invite our finalist,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:03.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,下面 有请我们的亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.76,0:00:06.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Aryna Sabalenka, who put up a hell
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.76,0:00:06.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,萨巴伦卡 她打了一场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:10.84,EN,,0,0,0,,of a battle, up to the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:10.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,了不起的苦战 请上台
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.84,0:00:31.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Aryna, we saw you just now speaking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.84,0:00:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,萨巴伦卡 我们刚看到你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:33.44,EN,,0,0,0,,with your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:33.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,在和团队说话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.44,0:00:34.40,EN,,0,0,0,,What did you say to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.44,0:00:34.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,你对他们说了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:37.60,EN,,0,0,0,,What did they say to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:37.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们又对你说了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:43.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:43.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.84,0:00:54.08,EN,,0,0,0,,We saw how much it means to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.84,0:00:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们都看得出这对你的分量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:56.72,EN,,0,0,0,,That's the last thing I can I want
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:56.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在我最不想做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:58.08,EN,,0,0,0,,to do right now is give a speech,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:58.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是站在这儿讲话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:01:00.24,EN,,0,0,0,,but I'll try my very best.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:01:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我会尽力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:04.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:04.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:10.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:10.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.64,0:01:12.96,EN,,0,0,0,,for your support throughout two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.64,0:01:12.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,这两周以来的支持
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:14.80,EN,,0,0,0,,It was it was amazing playing in front
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:14.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,能在你们面前打球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:15.36,EN,,0,0,0,,of you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:15.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.36,0:01:18.00,EN,,0,0,0,,And obviously I'm disappointed, but I want
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.36,0:01:18.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我当然很失望 但我想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.24,EN,,0,0,0,,to congratulate Elena on an incredible year,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜莱巴金娜 这一年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.24,0:01:21.44,EN,,0,0,0,,on incredible results.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.24,0:01:21.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,太出色 成绩也太出色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.44,0:01:27.04,EN,,0,0,0,,And well deserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.44,0:01:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,实至名归
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:28.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Enjoy it. Have fun tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:28.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,好好享受 今晚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.80,0:01:30.96,EN,,0,0,0,,tomorrow and till the end of the season
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.80,0:01:30.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,明天 一直玩到赛季结束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:33.12,EN,,0,0,0,,so I can play can win some titles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:33.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,这样我才能赢几个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.12,0:01:36.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.12,0:01:36.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.16,0:01:38.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you all of the sponsors
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.16,0:01:38.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢所有赞助商
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:40.88,EN,,0,0,0,,for making this event possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:40.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,让这项赛事得以举办
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.88,0:01:43.92,EN,,0,0,0,,And thank you I don't know everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.88,0:01:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,还要谢谢 我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:45.36,EN,,0,0,0,,who helped me throughout this two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:45.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,这两周帮过我的每个人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.36,0:01:46.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I really feel like home here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.36,0:01:46.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在这儿真的像在家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.72,0:01:49.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and cannot wait to come back next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.72,0:01:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,等不及明年再回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:51.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you to my team, to my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:51.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢我的团队 我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:54.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I wish I could perform
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:54.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真希望自己能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:58.16,EN,,0,0,0,,a little bit better.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:58.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得再好一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.16,0:01:59.76,EN,,0,0,0,,But I guess next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.16,0:01:59.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过 那就明年吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.76,0:02:01.42,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.76,0:02:01.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
